// Dialog :
"P3444827059" "You found a cache of collected coral"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3093448007" "You got the Coral Maros wanted."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P695916064" "Did you hold the Coral Heart you recovered? The feel of it, the weight of it... <br>Did you hear it call to you, did you hear it call to the sea? I suppose it doesn't matter. The future will proceed either way. I guess it might change whether you will understand it. <br><br>The next phase is ready. I am now supposed to wonder why the Freakshow would want the Coral. The next thing to do will be for you to find out."
// RandomFameString :
"P3565512693" "I hear that some crazy Freakshow cult is clashing with {VillainName}. To bad for them!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P578922632" "I've realized that you probably don't know how this all ends yet. I'm sorry about that. I forget these things. Ever since the tower fell, I have been at all places between two points. I forget that it's all linear to most people. Effects follow causes and causes precede effects. And I still live all those moments. <br><br>I'm sorry, {VillainName}. I was rambling. The Freakshow in the cult are going to try to kill you now, but since you don't yet know where to go to take the fight to them, they have the advantage. However, we can edit out all of the tedious searching for hideouts and interrogation.  <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I will tell you where to go. There, you'll find out about the cult that's overtaken the Freakshow on the Island.</A> It will bring you a step closer to escaping the horror at the end."
// AcceptString :
"P3171050023" "Make a pre-emptive strike against the Freakshow Cultists."
// SendOffString :
"P2152134084" "They call themselves the cult of... <br>Oh, I'm sorry. Causes, then effects. Go to the abandoned place I've shown you. Defeat the leader, find his journals, and you'll find out."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3150633218" "Strike Freakshow Cultists"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P968944930" "As you worked, I have prepared. All will be ready, but for now the book and the gatherer is what you need."

