// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - MetalShift 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1459282880" "You got some information from Metal Shift about his master"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2469834293" "You learned the name of the Cult of the Shaper's leader: Calystix"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1651483945" "Calystix the Shaper. How long have I waited to hear you speak that name? It all collapses now. It all converges to the second point. From a blossom of futures into the arrow of time. It's almost over. <br><br>So close to the end, I find I feel sad, in a way. I was there, I was part of it all when we first tried to build a tower to the heavens. When it happens again, what will become of me afterwards? Free, either way, I suppose. But that doesn't matter to you. You have your own horrific demise to avert. <br><br>Incidentally, how did you like meeting Barracuda? It's unfortunate that you'll have to fight her next time you meet."
// RandomFameString :
"P2886516162" "I heard {VillainName} was working with Barracuda! That's one villain on the way up."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P474944971" "You know the name 'Calystix', but you know nothing else. I will correct that. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The Legacy Chain's mystics have a great deal of information. Force one of their researchers to reveal all that they know about this Calystix to you.</A> Once you are armed with understanding, we will proceed."
// AcceptString :
"P1009254363" "Force information on Calystix from the Legacy Chain"
// SendOffString :
"P513215568" "The funny thing is, most of what I know about Calystix I remember from what you're about to tell me."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3359092063" "Force info from Legacy Chain"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3000076890" "Calystix the what? What are you talking about, {VillainName}? <br><br>Wait a moment... <br>Right, I remember now. You haven't told me about this yet. You need to get the information from the Legacy Chain so you can tell me, so I can tell you earlier. <br><br>As long as that's all clear."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3791055079" "Your trained eye can see the details that mark this innocuous office as different. A sigil here, a few strange carvings there. Powerful protective magics, but from your presence, obviously not powerful enough."

