// Dialog :
"P261950053" "All things are converging and everything falls into place. If what you are about to tell me is correct, you were able to find where Calystix has gone. The Shaper will try to unleash the Leviathan. He wants to send it to consume you so that the sacrifice of your wicked life will allow him to command it. And if you die now, it will all fall apart. A horrible fate awaits you. Now it is time to confront it."

