// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2804860249" "You have defeated the Shaper and prevented the Leviathan's resurrection."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3792397763" "The Shaper falls, and the way is clear. The Freaks will return to their normal ways, and Calystix will not summon the Leviathan this time. <br><br>You have averted one of the fates that could overcome you, but it is not the only one that awaits you. There's little more I can tell you without making events fly too far off course. You need to not know certain things, but I will tell you this: When the time comes, when you must face the goddess in your preparations to make Recluse's Victory become true, you must remember that Recluse's Victory may not be your own. <br><br>Now I've talked too much of fates and endings. I've said too much of what hasn't occurred and what may never happen. Let us be done with talk of destiny, and prophecy, and the rest. <br><br>At least, for a while."
// RandomFameString :
"P810491289" "I heard that some crazy Freakshow cult tried to sacrifice {VillainName} to their god. That couldn't have ended well for them."

